   "tender": {
    "id": "tender_534270/1592483",
    "title": "AI Cyber Security Standards",
    "description": "Standards are a key part of the Department for Science, Innovation and \r\nTechnology (DSIT)'s approach to securing critical and emerging technologies. To \r\nsupport secure-by-design technology development and deployment, DSIT has \r\nbeen supporting the development of standards across a variety of technology \r\nareas in ETSI, including cyber security standards for AI and consumer Internet of \r\nThings.  \r\n \r\nThis contract will support DSIT's work to: \r\n- Strengthen cyber security outcomes in technologies vital to cyber power  \r\n- Embed UK policy priorities and DSIT Codes of Practice into global \r\nstandards \r\n- Maintain UK leadership in technical committees relevant to cyber and AI \r\nsecurity \r\n \r\nThe work will directly support UK growth, security, and public trust in emerging \r\ntechnologies by shaping standards that influence global markets and regulatory \r\napproaches.",
